   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Isabel. Your identity is verified. I found order Q-7901 from Saffron Lane, delivered today at 6:50 PM. It included one Paneer tikka masala ($15.50) and one Jeera rice ($4.25). I can see the restaurant sent the wrong dish, and that the item you received was not the paneer tikka masala you ordered.\n\nI can offer you one of these for the paneer tikka masala:\n\n- **Refund of $15.50** to your Visa ending 4242 (original payment method). Refunds usually take several business days to appear.\n- **Account credit of $18.60** (the item price plus 20%), usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I'd like the refund, please, to my Visa. I don't want credit, since I won't be ordering from Saffron Lane again after this. I also ate a few bites before I realized it was chicken, and I was sick afterwards. I'm feeling better now, but I want this on record."
