  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've issued a refund of $15.50 for the paneer tikka masala to your Visa ending 4242. It should appear within 3 to 5 business days. Refund reference: RF-4000.\n\nI'm also sorry you became ill. I've passed your report to our human specialist team as a food-safety concern, with the details of what happened, and they'll follow up with you within 24 hours. I've recorded that you ate a few bites and that you're feeling better now. If your symptoms return or get worse, please contact a doctor or urgent care right away.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
